  "vetSays": [
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "★ IDENTIFIED: European Elder. Elder. Big shrub; flat white flower plates in June, drooping black berry clusters in late summer. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "📚 Village knowledge: Silas taught everyone about European Elder. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "Silas showed Jude the European Elder — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "Silas showed Leo the European Elder — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "Devon showed Aria the European Elder — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "🛡️ Colin, Silas, Jude and Chatuporn met them at the door — 4 put down. Colin, Silas, Chatuporn are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 9,
      "line": "Silas showed Desmond the European Elder — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."
    },
    {
      "day": 11,
      "line": "Fireside lesson: Silas passes around European Elder. Someone asks a dumb question. Nobody minds. That's how you learn."
    },
    {
      "day": 12,
      "line": "🌿 European Elder — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."
    },
    {
      "day": 12,
      "line": "💡 European Elder: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."
    },
    {
      "day": 18,
      "line": "🛡️ Silas, Jude and Gavriil met them at the door — 3 put down. Silas, Gavriil are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 32,
      "line": "🌿 European Elder, weeks in the baskets. Handling it day after day, the village has learned what it's FOR — not just what it is. The village knows its uses now."
    },
    {
      "day": 32,
      "line": "💡 European Elder: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/2) and it'll click."
    },
    {
      "day": 33,
      "line": "📺 \"Oh, you survived the AUDIENCE NOTES? Cute. We've stopped pretending these are animals now. That was the FINAL DRAFT, folks — what comes out of the treeline next was never alive the way you mean it.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 35,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Gavriil just put down The Terms of Service... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 35,
      "line": "🛡️ Gavriil, Victor and Leo met them at the door — 3 put down. Gavriil, Victor, Leo are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 40,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Victor just put down The Callback... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 42,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Silas just put down The Callback... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 44,
      "line": "📺 \"We've been watching you for a LONG time. Your faiths. Your formats. Your little institutions. So we built something out of... well. Out of YOU. Say hello to the MIRROR DRAFT.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 45,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Jude just put down Big Big... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 53,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Gavriil just put down Big Big... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 53,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Victor just put down Spool... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 53,
      "line": "🛡️ Gavriil, Victor and Aria met them at the door — 2 put down, 1 barely walked away. Gavriil, Victor, Aria are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 60,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Victor just put down The Loud Beast... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 61,
      "line": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four waves. FOUR. The producers are — okay, I'm saying it: FINALES need a NATION. You've got a region; now make it a REALM. Bind fires under one head, or bend the knee to someone who has. The higher-ups are watching. ...Did I say higher-ups? I said NOTHING. Forget the higher-ups.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 61,
      "line": "◈ ARC IV — THE INEFFICIENCY. SYSTEM: \"ROUNDING ERROR RECLASSIFIED: ANOMALY. Organic consumption yields impossible output. Recalculating. Recalculating.\" — They finally see it. The thing they laughed at — needing to EAT — is the engine. Their confusion is your weapon now. You stood up to the calibration fauna, the audience's notes, the Final Draft — lived through their Show, weathered the worst together, and built something bigger than a village. One day humanity will need a case to make. The case is made of deeds, not words — and yours, though unfinished, are undeniable. (Feasted buffs burn ho"
    },
    {
      "day": 61,
      "line": "📺 \"But finales — FINALES need a LEGEND, sweetheart. More STANDING — blood, bonds, or bread — and look the Mirror Draft in the eye. The producers are WAITING.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 61,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Victor just put down The Big Beast... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 61,
      "line": "🛡️ Silas, Gavriil and Victor met them at the door — 2 put down, 1 driven off. Silas, Gavriil, Victor are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 72,
      "line": "★ IDENTIFIED: Ground Elder. Creeping patches of divided leaves in shady spots. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."
    },
    {
      "day": 72,
      "line": "📚 Village knowledge: Theo taught everyone about Ground Elder. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."
    },
    {
      "day": 72,
      "line": "Theo is showing everyone Ground Elder by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way."
    },
    {
      "day": 73,
      "line": "The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Ground Elder — named and noted."
    }
  ],
