  "vetSays": [
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\" Company makes the road shorter."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek came back with 422 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "💧 A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek returns with water: +3 clean."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\" Better close to the fire today."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "📋 A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek — 🪾 Gather deadfall. They'll report back by next part."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "🍂 A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek gathers deadfall — 1 stick + 1 fiber. The pile grows. (2 sticks now.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "line": "You catch fragments by the fire — Juan telling A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek about you. The retelling is already better than the event."
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "line": "💧 A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek returns with water: +3 clean."
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "line": "A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\" The pantry won't fill itself."
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about something. Get OUT of the water. When the crackling starts, step onto dry ground — the discharge cannot reach you there. On land it is just a long blind fish: slow, harmless, dinner. Never fight it standing in the creek.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "You catch fragments by the fire — Ikram telling A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "💧 A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek returns with water: +4 clean."
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\" The pantry won't fill itself."
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "You catch fragments by the fire — Juan telling A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek about Ikram. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "💧 A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek returns with water: +2 clean."
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "Brian showed A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek the Muscadine Grapes — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\" The pantry won't fill itself."
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "💧 A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek returns with water: +2 clean."
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "Ikram is showing A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek how to tie a snare. Hands patient. It takes three tries."
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek came back with 490 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 245 kcal in, 245 kcal eaten at the fire."
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "You catch fragments by the fire — Juan telling A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "You catch fragments by the fire — A man, maybe 40s, with tattooed arms telling A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek about himself. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\" The pantry won't fill itself."
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "Jude showed A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek the Pawpaw — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "🔥 The fire settles. Henry has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"The thing with headlights for eyes, standing too still — I put it down today.\" \"Its legs lock. White light wells behind its eyes.\" \"It drops its head — the antlers come around in a short, vicious arc.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Ikram says quietly \"Tell me you didn't go alone.\" the man in his 50s, with a scarred cheek mutters \"Say that again — slower.\" Someone at the edge of the light says what everyone's thinking: \"So — what are we calling it?\""
    },
    {
      "day": 12,
      "line": "🛡️ Brian, Grayson, Juan and Daniyar met them at the door — 3 put down, 1 driven off. Brian, Grayson, Juan, Daniyar are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "📺 \"Oh, you survived the AUDIENCE NOTES? Cute. We've stopped pretending these are animals now. That was the FINAL DRAFT, folks — what comes out of the treeline next was never alive the way you mean it.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Ikram just put down Chorus Line... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "🛡️ Brian, Grayson and Ikram met them at the door — 3 put down. Brian, Grayson, Ikram are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 38,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Daniyar just put down Ad Break... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 38,
      "line": "🛡️ Hank, Juan, Daniyar, Nikos and Henry met them at the door — 3 put down, 1 barely walked away. Juan didn't come back. Hank, Daniyar, Nikos, Henry are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 45,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Thabo just put down Spool... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 45,
      "line": "🛡️ Hank, Ikram, Daniyar, Nikos and Henry met them at the door — 2 put down, 1 driven off, 2 barely walked away. Hank, Ikram, Daniyar, Nikos, Henry are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 46,
      "line": "📺 \"We've been watching you for a LONG time. Your faiths. Your formats. Your little institutions. So we built something out of... well. Out of YOU. Say hello to the MIRROR DRAFT.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 49,
      "line": "📓 Codex: you've heard of Cold-Blooded. Someone, somewhere, can do this. Now you know its name."
    },
    {
      "day": 49,
      "line": "◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Daniyar — Craft 2. Three offers; they took Cold-Blooded. Earned, chosen. (cold_blooded: villager level-up)"
    },
    {
      "day": 49,
      "line": "📓 Codex: Daniyar chose Cold-Blooded (cold_blooded) at Craft 2."
    },
    {
      "day": 55,
      "line": "🛡️ Chloe, Elijah and Tiaki met them at the door — 2 put down, 1 barely walked away. Chloe, Elijah, Tiaki are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 56,
      "line": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four waves. FOUR. The producers are — okay, I'm saying it: FINALES need a NATION. You've got a region; now make it a REALM. Bind fires under one head, or bend the knee to someone who has. The higher-ups are watching. ...Did I say higher-ups? I said NOTHING. Forget the higher-ups.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 56,
      "line": "◈ ARC IV — THE INEFFICIENCY. SYSTEM: \"ROUNDING ERROR RECLASSIFIED: ANOMALY. Organic consumption yields impossible output. Recalculating. Recalculating.\" — They finally see it. The thing they laughed at — needing to EAT — is the engine. Their confusion is your weapon now. You stood up to the calibration fauna, the audience's notes, the Final Draft — lived through their Show, weathered the worst together, and built something bigger than a village. One day humanity will need a case to make. The case is made of deeds, not words — and yours, though unfinished, are undeniable. (Feasted buffs burn ho"
    },
    {
      "day": 57,
      "line": "📺 \"But finales — FINALES need a LEGEND, sweetheart. More STANDING — blood, bonds, or bread — and look the Mirror Draft in the eye. The producers are WAITING.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 71,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Tariq just put down The Loud Beast... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 72,
      "line": "🪞 You wake up somebody else. Daniyar Askarov, 33 — a paramedic. His hands know different work now: Iron Stomach, Green Whisper, Cold-Blooded, Berserker Rage, Translator."
    },
    {
      "day": 77,
      "line": "Cold-blooded: your body budgets like an accountant. (-20% food need today)"
    },
    {
      "day": 88,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Tiaki just put down Big-Eyes... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 88,
      "line": "🛡️ Yara, Chloe and Tiaki met them at the door — 1 put down, 1 driven off, 1 barely walked away. Yara, Tiaki are hurt."
    }
  ],
