  "vetSays": [
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "🛡️ Milo, the person in their 20s, with a crooked nose, the pharmacist, Inci and Iken met them at the door — 4 put down. Milo, the person in their 20s, with a crooked nose, the pharmacist, Inci, Iken are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 14,
      "line": "🛡️ Milo, Debbie, Inci, Sigrun and Rosa met them at the door — 5 put down. Milo, Debbie, Inci, Sigrun, Rosa are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 22,
      "line": "🛡️ Courtney, Inci, Sigrun, Tom and Sofia met them at the door — 4 put down, 1 driven off. Courtney, Inci, Sigrun, Tom, Sofia are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 23,
      "line": "✨ Ability gained: Cold-Blooded (L1). You need 20% less food in cold weather. Your body budgets like an accountant."
    },
    {
      "day": 23,
      "line": "Cold-blooded: your body budgets like an accountant. (-20% food need today)"
    },
    {
      "day": 24,
      "line": "📓 Codex: you UNDERSTAND Cold-Blooded. It resonates with: something unnamed."
    },
    {
      "day": 24,
      "line": "⬆️ Cold-Blooded deepened to L2! Winter is a rumor."
    },
    {
      "day": 24,
      "line": "💛 You hold Unnamed photograph and practice — one gift, deeply. They would want you to get better at this. (+6 experience to Cold-Blooded)"
    },
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "📺 \"Oh, you survived the AUDIENCE NOTES? Cute. We've stopped pretending these are animals now. That was the FINAL DRAFT, folks — what comes out of the treeline next was never alive the way you mean it.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 34,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Debbie just put down The Terms of Service... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 34,
      "line": "🛡️ Courtney, Debbie, Inci, Sigrun and Rosa met them at the door — 4 put down, 1 driven off. Courtney, Debbie, Inci, Sigrun, Rosa are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 41,
      "line": "Cold-blooded: your body budgets like an accountant. (-20% food need today)"
    },
    {
      "day": 43,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Sigrun just put down The Ugly Beast... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 44,
      "line": "★ IDENTIFIED: Ground Elder. Creeping patches of divided leaves in shady spots. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."
    },
    {
      "day": 44,
      "line": "Ella was watching. Now they know Ground Elder too."
    },
    {
      "day": 45,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Debbie just put down Spool... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 45,
      "line": "📺 \"We've been watching you for a LONG time. Your faiths. Your formats. Your little institutions. So we built something out of... well. Out of YOU. Say hello to the MIRROR DRAFT.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 45,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Tom just put down The Redactor... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 45,
      "line": "🛡️ Courtney, Debbie, Sigrun, Rosa and Tom met them at the door — 3 put down, 2 driven off. Debbie, Rosa, Tom are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 46,
      "line": "Rosa showed Courtney the Ground Elder — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."
    },
    {
      "day": 46,
      "line": "Tom showed Sigrun the Ground Elder — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."
    },
    {
      "day": 53,
      "line": "◈ ARC IV — THE INEFFICIENCY. SYSTEM: \"ROUNDING ERROR RECLASSIFIED: ANOMALY. Organic consumption yields impossible output. Recalculating. Recalculating.\" — They finally see it. The thing they laughed at — needing to EAT — is the engine. Their confusion is your weapon now. You stood up to the calibration fauna, the audience's notes, the Final Draft — lived through their Show, weathered the worst together, and built something bigger than a village. One day humanity will need a case to make. The case is made of deeds, not words — and yours, though unfinished, are undeniable. (Feasted buffs burn ho"
    },
    {
      "day": 54,
      "line": "📺 \"But finales — FINALES need a LEGEND, sweetheart. More STANDING — blood, bonds, or bread — and look the Mirror Draft in the eye. The producers are WAITING.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 55,
      "line": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four waves. FOUR. The producers are — okay, I'm saying it: FINALES need a NATION. You've got a region; now make it a REALM. Bind fires under one head, or bend the knee to someone who has. The higher-ups are watching. ...Did I say higher-ups? I said NOTHING. Forget the higher-ups.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 64,
      "line": "Sigrun: \"Ground Elder is coming back thick on the damp slope. Not new — but it's holding.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 68,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Debbie just put down Big Big... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 73,
      "line": "⚠ This one is different — bigger, and it didn't come alone. A Pack-leader veteran."
    },
    {
      "day": 73,
      "line": "⚠️ Two threats: Pack-leader The Focus Group (×2) and an eye-head (×7) — all here, all now.\nYour party: just you. You are outnumbered — fight like it."
    },
    {
      "day": 81,
      "line": "⚠ This one is different — bigger, and it didn't come alone. A Pack-leader veteran."
    },
    {
      "day": 81,
      "line": "⚠️ 1 threats: Pack-leader Buffering (×2) — all here, all now.\nYour party: just you. You are outnumbered — fight like it."
    },
    {
      "day": 81,
      "line": "💥 The Pack-leader Buffering SNAPS! No warning. There never is."
    },
    {
      "day": 81,
      "line": "The Pack-leader Buffering falls."
    },
    {
      "day": 81,
      "line": "📺 +20 style — dropped the Pack-leader Buffering!"
    },
    {
      "day": 145,
      "line": "📻 The producers name it: the Nielsen. Ratings embodied. It fights boring — and the crowd adores it for that."
    }
  ],
