  "vetSays": [
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "🛡️ Declan, Hugo, Booker, Chunmei and Harper met them at the door — 4 put down, 1 driven off. Declan, Hugo, Booker, Harper are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 17,
      "line": "🛡️ Hugo, Chunmei, Harper and Mia met them at the door — 4 put down. Hugo, Chunmei, Harper, Mia are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "📺 \"Oh, you survived the AUDIENCE NOTES? Cute. We've stopped pretending these are animals now. That was the FINAL DRAFT, folks — what comes out of the treeline next was never alive the way you mean it.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 28,
      "line": "🛡️ Booker, Chunmei, Mia and Farid met them at the door — 3 put down, 1 driven off. Booker, Mia, Farid are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 32,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Vasyl just put down Chorus Line... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 39,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Declan just put down The Focus Group... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 42,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Vasyl just put down The Callback... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 43,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Stan just put down Spool... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 43,
      "line": "📺 \"We've been watching you for a LONG time. Your faiths. Your formats. Your little institutions. So we built something out of... well. Out of YOU. Say hello to the MIRROR DRAFT.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 43,
      "line": "🛡️ Chunmei, Harper, Farid and Stan met them at the door — 3 put down, 1 driven off. Farid, Stan are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 50,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Booker just put down The Loud Beast... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 50,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Harper just put down Big-Eyes... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 50,
      "line": "🛡️ Declan, Booker, Harper and Farid met them at the door — 3 put down, 1 barely walked away. Declan, Booker, Harper, Farid are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 62,
      "line": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four waves. FOUR. The producers are — okay, I'm saying it: FINALES need a NATION. You've got a region; now make it a REALM. Bind fires under one head, or bend the knee to someone who has. The higher-ups are watching. ...Did I say higher-ups? I said NOTHING. Forget the higher-ups.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 62,
      "line": "◈ ARC IV — THE INEFFICIENCY. SYSTEM: \"ROUNDING ERROR RECLASSIFIED: ANOMALY. Organic consumption yields impossible output. Recalculating. Recalculating.\" — They finally see it. The thing they laughed at — needing to EAT — is the engine. Their confusion is your weapon now. You stood up to the calibration fauna, the audience's notes, the Final Draft — lived through their Show, weathered the worst together, and built something bigger than a village. One day humanity will need a case to make. The case is made of deeds, not words — and yours, though unfinished, are undeniable. (Feasted buffs burn ho"
    },
    {
      "day": 63,
      "line": "📺 \"But finales — FINALES need a LEGEND, sweetheart. More STANDING — blood, bonds, or bread — and look the Mirror Draft in the eye. The producers are WAITING.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 135,
      "line": "📻 The producers name it: the Nielsen. Ratings embodied. It fights boring — and the crowd adores it for that."
    },
    {
      "day": 150,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Ava just put down The Herald... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 150,
      "line": "🛡️ Ava met them at the door — 1 put down."
    }
  ],
