    {
      "day": 3,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek picks through the bag, frowning. Nothing they can name with confidence. (8 ticks)"
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "📋 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "💧 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek returns with 5L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "🪨 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "\"Can we talk?\" A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "📋 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "Just you and A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek. You press some Muscadine Grapes into their hands. No one sees. That matters, somehow."
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "🪨 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (2 stone now.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "🌱 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "🌿 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~6 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "🪵 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (38 logs now.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek telling A person, maybe 50s about Greta. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek telling A person, maybe 50s about Greta. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "📋 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "🪵 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (47 logs now.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 5,
      "line": "📓 Journal: Sanne taught the person in their 30s, with a scarred cheek Food Preservation."
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "🌱 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "🌿 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~7 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "💧 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek returns with 7L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek showed Ursula the Blackberry — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek heads out to check the snares. \"Wire doesn't lie.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek telling A person, maybe 50s about Katarina. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "🔥 The fire settles. Greta has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"A moth the size of a dinner plate, catching light wrong — I put it down today.\" \"It lands. It folds its wings. The light in the clearing changes, like someone adjusting a lamp.\" \"It lets go of the air and simply... drifts. Somewhere else. Hard to predict.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Elena says \"We've been walking past those.\" the person in their 30s, with a scarred cheek says quietly \"Did it look at you? Before?\" Someone at the edge of the light says what everyone's thinking: \"So — "
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "📋 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "🪨 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (7 stone now.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "🪤 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek is back. \"Snares were empty. They'll keep.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "🪤 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek catches you watching the snares come off the line. \"...Want to actually SEE one?\" They show you — the loop, the trigger stick, where the run narrows between the roots. \"Opossum trails. Check at dawn. Always.\" Your hands don't know it yet. Your eyes do."
    },
    {
      "day": 6,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "📋 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "💧 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek returns with 9L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "📋 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "🪵 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek hauls back 7 wood. The pile grows. (75 logs now.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\" The pantry won't fill itself."
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "📋 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "🪨 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (10 stone now.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 40s telling Ursula about A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "Back at the haven the argument starts: the person in their 30s, with a scarred cheek is calling it \"The Big Beast.\" They'll fight it out — weigh in if you want."
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "You catch fragments by the fire — Ursula telling A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek about themself. The retelling is already better than the event."
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "Back at the haven the argument starts: the person in their 30s, with a scarred cheek is calling it \"Loud-Eyes.\" Nobody agrees yet — weigh in if you want."
    },
    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "🛡️ Tyrone, Greta, Connor and Yuji met them at the door — 2 put down, 2 driven off. Tyrone, Greta, Connor, Yuji are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 24,
      "line": "⚠ This one is different — bigger, and it didn't come alone. A Pack-leader veteran."
    },
    {
      "day": 24,
      "line": "⚠️ 1 threats: Pack-leader The Loud Beast (×2) — all here, all now.\nYour party: just you. You are outnumbered — fight like it."
    },
    {
      "day": 24,
      "line": "The Pack-leader The Loud Beast falls."
    },
    {
      "day": 24,
      "line": "📺 +20 style — dropped the Pack-leader The Loud Beast!"
    },
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "🛡️ Tyrone, Connor, Kyrylo, Sanne and Elena met them at the door — 4 put down, 1 driven off. Tyrone, Connor, Kyrylo, Sanne are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 32,
      "line": "📺 \"Oh, you survived the AUDIENCE NOTES? Cute. We've stopped pretending these are animals now. That was the FINAL DRAFT, folks — what comes out of the treeline next was never alive the way you mean it.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 38,
      "line": "⚠ This one is different — old, patient, unhurried — it has seen your kind before. An Elder veteran."
    },
    {
      "day": 38,
      "line": "Connor strikes the Elder Inspiration."
    },
    {
      "day": 38,
      "line": "🛡️ Tyrone, Greta, Sanne, Elena and Ursula met them at the door — 3 put down, 2 driven off. Elena, Ursula are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 45,
      "line": "📺 \"We've been watching you for a LONG time. Your faiths. Your formats. Your little institutions. So we built something out of... well. Out of YOU. Say hello to the MIRROR DRAFT.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 45,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Sanne just put down The Terms of Service... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 45,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Elena just put down The Focus Group... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 45,
      "line": "🛡️ Greta, Connor, Sanne, Elena and Katarina met them at the door — 4 put down, 1 driven off. Connor, Sanne, Elena, Katarina are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 70,
      "line": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four waves. FOUR. The producers are — okay, I'm saying it: FINALES need a NATION. You've got a region; now make it a REALM. Bind fires under one head, or bend the knee to someone who has. The higher-ups are watching. ...Did I say higher-ups? I said NOTHING. Forget the higher-ups.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 70,
      "line": "◈ ARC IV — THE INEFFICIENCY. SYSTEM: \"ROUNDING ERROR RECLASSIFIED: ANOMALY. Organic consumption yields impossible output. Recalculating. Recalculating.\" — They finally see it. The thing they laughed at — needing to EAT — is the engine. Their confusion is your weapon now. You stood up to the calibration fauna, the audience's notes, the Final Draft — lived through their Show, weathered the worst together, and built something bigger than a village. One day humanity will need a case to make. The case is made of deeds, not words — and yours, though unfinished, are undeniable. (Feasted buffs burn ho"
    },
    {
      "day": 71,
      "line": "📺 \"But finales — FINALES need a LEGEND, sweetheart. More STANDING — blood, bonds, or bread — and look the Mirror Draft in the eye. The producers are WAITING.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 79,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Ursula just put down The Strike... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 79,
      "line": "📺 \"You've gotten too big for the story. Ratings are GREAT, by the way — but you're threatening the narrative now. So the narrative is fighting back. Meet the PRODUCERS.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 80,
      "line": "★ IDENTIFIED: European Elder. Elder. Big shrub; flat white flower plates in June, drooping black berry clusters in late summer. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."
    },
    {
      "day": 80,
      "line": "📚 Village knowledge: Sanne taught everyone about European Elder. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."
    },
    {
      "day": 80,
      "line": "Fireside lesson: Sanne passes around European Elder. Someone asks a dumb question. Nobody minds. That's how you learn."
    },
    {
      "day": 81,
      "line": "The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: European Elder — named and noted."
    },
